## Anatomy of a Production-Ready Prompt

```markdown
### Task
Refactor the API error handler in `src/features/checkout/PaymentForm.tsx`.

### Requirements
1. Extract errors using the keys defined in `APIErrorResponse` (`error.code`, `error.message`).
2. Pass the extracted string to the existing `<Alert variant="danger" />` component above the submit button.
3. Add a 3-second disabled state on the `<Button />` upon error to prevent rapid re-submission.

### Guardrails
- Do not modify `usePaymentMutation` hook signatures.
- Do not introduce inline styles; use Tailwind utility classes consistent with the existing form elements.

```
